 -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\\end{aligned}\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186260287 :answer/value "r=⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2⟩+t⟨2,\\,3,\\,-1⟩,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" "\\mathbf{r}=⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2⟩+t⟨2,\\,3,\\,-1⟩,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/cas 17592186260712 :answer/value "r=⟨2,\\,3,\\,-1⟩+⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2⟩" "\\mathbf{r}=⟨2,\\,3,\\,-1⟩+⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2⟩"] [:db/cas 17592186261065 :answer/value "r=⟨2,\\,3,\\,-1⟩+t⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2⟩,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" "\\mathbf{r}=⟨2,\\,3,\\,-1⟩+t⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2⟩,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/cas 17592186261097 :answer/value "r=⟨-2,\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,\\sqrt{5}⟩+t⟨-1,\\,2,\\,3⟩,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" "\\mathbf{r}=⟨-2,\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,\\sqrt{5}⟩+t⟨-1,\\,2,\\,3⟩,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/cas 17592186261840 :answer/value "r=⟨2,\\,-1,\\,3⟩+t⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,-2,\\,\\frac{3}{5}⟩,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" "\\mathbf{r}=⟨2,\\,-1,\\,3⟩+t⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,-2,\\,\\frac{3}{5}⟩,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/cas 17592186262614 :question/problem "Find a vector equation of the straight line passing through $Q(\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2)$ and parallel to $v=⟨2,\\,3,\\,-1⟩.$" "Find a vector equation of the straight line passing through $Q(\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2)$ and parallel to $\\mathbf{v}=⟨2,\\,3,\\,-1⟩.$"] [:db/cas 17592186262614 :question/worked-solution "The vector equation of the straight line passing through $Q$ and parallel to $v$ is given by\n\n$$\nr=q+tv,\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )$ and $q$ is the position vector of $Q.$ \n\nIn our case, the position vector of the point $Q$ is $q=⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2⟩.$ \n\nUsing the formula for the vector equation of a line, we have\n\n$$\nr=⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2⟩+t⟨2,\\,3,\\,-1⟩,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$" "The vector equation of the straight line passing through $Q$ and parallel to $\\mathbf{v}$ is given by\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{r}=\\mathbf{q}+t\\mathbf{v},\n$$\n\nwhere $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )$ and $\\mathbf{q}$ is the position vector of $Q.$ \n\nIn our case, the position vector of the point $Q$ is $\\mathbf{q}=⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2⟩.$ \n\nUsing the formula for the vector equation of a line, we have\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{r}=⟨\\sqrt{5},\\,\\frac{3}{5},\\,-2⟩+t⟨2,\\,3,\\,-1⟩,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).\n$$"] [:db/cas 17592186300471 :answer/value "r=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{2} \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" "\\mathbf{r}=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}-\\sqrt{2} \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/cas 17592186300613 :answer/value "r=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" "\\mathbf{r}=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/cas 17592186300688 :answer/value "r=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}" "\\mathbf{r}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}"] [:db/cas 17592186301027 :answer/value "r=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" "\\mathbf{r}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/cas 17592186301149 :answer/value "r=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix},\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )" "\\mathbf{r}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -\\sqrt{2} \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+t\\begin{bmatrix}9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix},\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )"] [:db/cas 